  "objectives": [
    "說得出留數的定義 $\\operatorname{Res}_{z_0}f=a_{-1}$，以及它的意義：繞 $z_0$ 一小圈的積分等於 $2\\pi i\\operatorname{Res}_{z_0}f$",
    "用三個公式算留數：簡單極點 $\\lim(z-z_0)f$、$f=\\frac{g}{h}$ 型 $\\frac{g(z_0)}{h'(z_0)}$、$m$ 階極點的導數公式",
    "公式不好用時直接從 Laurent 級數讀 $a_{-1}$，並知道可去奇異點的留數是 $0$"
  ],
  "visual": null,
  "concept": [
    {
      "heading": "① 定義",
      "body": [
        "$z_0$ 是孤立奇異點，在 $0<|z-z_0|<R$ 上 $f=\\sum a_n(z-z_0)^n$：",
        "意義：繞 $z_0$ 一小圈",
        "• 可去奇異點：沒有負次方 ⇒ 留數 $=0$",
        "• 本性奇異點也有留數：$e^{1/z}=1+\\frac1z+\\cdots$，$\\operatorname{Res}_0=1$",
        "所以算留數 = 算出 $a_{-1}$；不必把整個級數寫出來"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\operatorname{Res}_{z_0}f=a_{-1}",
        "\\oint_{|z-z_0|=\\rho}f\\,dz=2\\pi i\\operatorname{Res}_{z_0}f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "② 簡單極點：公式 1",
      "body": [
        "理由：$(z-z_0)f=a_{-1}+a_0(z-z_0)+\\cdots\\to a_{-1}$",
        "例：$\\operatorname{Res}_{z=i}\\dfrac1{z^2+1}$，$z^2+1=(z-i)(z+i)$",
        "數值驗算：$\\frac1{2\\pi i}\\oint_{|z-i|=0.01}\\approx-0.5\\,i$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\operatorname{Res}_{z_0}f=\\lim_{z\\to z_0}(z-z_0)f(z)",
        "\\lim_{z\\to i}\\frac{z-i}{(z-i)(z+i)}=\\frac{1}{2i}=-\\frac i2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "② 簡單極點：公式 2",
      "body": [
        "$f=\\dfrac gh$，$g(z_0)\\ne0$，$h(z_0)=0$，$h'(z_0)\\ne0$：",
        "證明：用公式 1，再用導數的定義：",
        "跟羅必達的想法一樣；分母不必分解",
        "例：$\\operatorname{Res}_{z=0}\\cot z=\\operatorname{Res}_{z=0}\\dfrac{\\cos z}{\\sin z}$",
        "$g=\\cos z$，$h=\\sin z$，$h'=\\cos z$：",
        "同樣的算法：在每個 $k\\pi$，$\\dfrac{\\cos k\\pi}{\\cos k\\pi}=1$",
        "對照：$\\frac1{z^2+1}$ 用公式 2：$\\frac{1}{2z}\\big|_{z=i}=\\frac1{2i}$，跟公式 1 一樣"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\operatorname{Res}_{z_0}\\frac gh=\\frac{g(z_0)}{h'(z_0)}",
        "\\lim_{z\\to z_0}\\frac{(z-z_0)\\,g(z)}{h(z)}=\\lim\\frac{g(z)}{\\frac{h(z)-h(z_0)}{z-z_0}}=\\frac{g(z_0)}{h'(z_0)}",
        "\\operatorname{Res}_0\\cot z=\\frac{\\cos0}{\\cos0}=1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "② 公式 2 的威力",
      "body": [
        "例：$\\dfrac1{1+z^4}$ 在 $z_0=e^{i\\pi/4}$（$z_0^4=-1$）",
        "$g=1$，$h=1+z^4$，$h'=4z^3$：",
        "數值驗算：$\\frac1{2\\pi i}\\oint_{|z-z_0|=0.01}\\frac{dz}{1+z^4}$ 一致；最後一課會用到",
        "不用把 $1+z^4$ 分解成四個一次因式"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\operatorname{Res}_{z_0}=\\frac1{4z_0^3}=\\frac{z_0}{4z_0^4}=-\\frac{z_0}{4}",
        "-\\frac{z_0}4=-\\frac{1+i}{4\\sqrt2}\\approx-0.1768-0.1768\\,i"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ $m$ 階極點",
      "body": [
        "理由：$(z-z_0)^mf=a_{-m}+\\cdots+a_{-1}(z-z_0)^{m-1}+a_0(z-z_0)^m+\\cdots$",
        "$a_{-1}$ 是這個冪級數的第 $m-1$ 個係數 $=\\dfrac{(\\cdots)^{(m-1)}(z_0)}{(m-1)!}$",
        "例：$\\operatorname{Res}_{z=1}\\dfrac{e^z}{(z-1)^2}$，$m=2$",
        "$(z-1)^2f=e^z$，微分一次："
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\operatorname{Res}_{z_0}f=\\frac{1}{(m-1)!}\\lim_{z\\to z_0}\\frac{d^{m-1}}{dz^{m-1}}\\Big[(z-z_0)^mf(z)\\Big]",
        "\\operatorname{Res}_1=\\frac1{1!}\\,\\frac{d}{dz}e^z\\Big|_{z=1}=e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 直接讀係數",
      "body": [
        "例：$\\operatorname{Res}_{z=0}\\dfrac{e^z}{z^4}$（四階極點）",
        "公式很難用時：$\\operatorname{Res}_{z=0}\\dfrac{1}{z^2\\sin z}$（三階極點）",
        "$\\sin z=z\\big(1-\\frac{z^2}{6}+\\cdots\\big)$，用 $\\frac1{1-w}=1+w+\\cdots$：",
        "$\\operatorname{Res}_0=\\dfrac16$",
        "數值驗算：$\\frac1{2\\pi i}\\oint_{|z|=0.01}\\approx0.16667$"
